menu "Radio Unit"

    config RADIO_ENABLE_CONSOLE
        bool "Enable serial debug console"
        default y
        help
            Builds the esp_console REPL on UART0 for bench debugging. Disable for the
            remote unit, which has no console and runs only the Interface API.

    config RADIO_ENABLE_COMMAND_SERVER
        bool "Enable over-the-air command server"
        depends on !RADIO_ENABLE_CONSOLE
        default n
        help
            Starts a task that answers over-the-air requests (PING, GET::TEL,
            GET::STATUS) with telemetry and status replies. Enabled on the remote
            unit. It consumes every received packet, so it cannot be combined with
            the console, whose cmd/recv commands also read received packets.

endmenu
